  "url": "https://new.web.cafe/tutorial/detail/62t8kvsqyy",
  "title": "打造一个属于自己的域名查询工具",
  "author": "Xi5h1r🔅",
  "authorAvatar": "https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/62t8kvsqyy_avatar.jpg",
  "tags": [],
  "content": "<h1 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">缘起</h1>\n<div>这个想法来自飞哥的两篇域名查询相关的分享（<a href=\"https://new.web.cafe/tutorial/detail/ho54rc4o8f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://new.web.cafe/tutorial/detail/ho54rc4o8f</a> 和 <a href=\"https://new.web.cafe/experience/v536db9tu5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://new.web.cafe/experience/v536db9tu5</a>），让我一直想做一个自己的域名查询工具</div>\n<div>准确来说，我想做一个更符合自己需求的关键词/域名工具 - 能够内嵌到 Trendsbar 侧边栏，具备以下功能特点：</div>\n<ul>\n<li>域名注册状态查询</li>\n<li>网站流量分析</li>\n<li>域名价格参考</li>\n<li>用户体验优秀</li>\n</ul>\n<h1 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">经验分享</h1>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">核心数据来源</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>域名信息\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.iana.org/domains/root/db\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">IANA 根域数据库</a></li>\n<li>WHOIS 和 RDAP 查询协议</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>其他数据\n<ul>\n<li>流量数据：SimilarWeb 懂得都懂</li>\n<li>域名比价：<a href=\"https://www.nazhumi.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.nazhumi.com/</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">RDAP 的优势与局限</h2>\n<div>RDAP 作为新一代域名查询协议，提供了标准的 JSON 响应格式，但目前面临的主要问题是支持度不够全面，需要做好降级使用 WHOIS 协议的方案。</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">WHOIS 解析的挑战</h2>\n<div>WHOIS 协议存在数据格式不统一的问题，主要体现在不同注册商的返回格式差异和字段名称不一致，这使得我们在提取关键信息（如注册/过期时间、注册人信息和 DNS 服务器配置）时面临较大挑战，需要针对不同注册商编写特定的解析规则。</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">保留域名处理</h2>\n<div>域名注册系统中的保留域名（Reserved Domains）需要特殊处理，主要包括以下几类：</div>\n<ul>\n<li>名称冲突保留：避免与现有系统或服务产生冲突的域名</li>\n<li>技术保留：用于技术测试和示例的域名（如 example.com、test.com 等）</li>\n<li>政策保留：基于政策考虑而保留的域名（如国家名称、IANA 特殊用途域名等）</li>\n<li>商标保护：包含知名商标或品牌的域名，以防止恶意抢注和侵权</li>\n</ul>\n<div>解决方案：</div>\n<ol>\n<li>从 RDAP 和 WHOIS 返回结果中识别特定字段，如: reserved、blocked、prohibited</li>\n<li>谷歌管理的域名可以直接调用其公开 API 查询，示例：\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: slategray;\">// 查询 example.app 域名</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token literal-property\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">https</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>pubapi</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">registry</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">google</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>check</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">?</span><span>domain</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">=</span><span>example</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">app</span></code></div></pre>\n支持的谷歌域名后缀：\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">app、</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">ing、</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">day、</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">new、</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">dev、</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">soy、</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">dad、</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">foo、</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">mov、</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">how、</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">nexus、</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">esq、</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">page、</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">prof、</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">rsvp、</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">phd、</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">みんな、</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">channely、</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">meme、</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">zip、</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">boo</span></code></div></pre>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">部署与缓存</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>核心接口放到 Cloudflare Workers 使用边缘计算避免单一 IP 容易被 ban，结合 Cloudflare KV 存储实现分布式缓存</li>\n<li>针对不同类型数据设置差异化的缓存过期策略</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">流式数据传输</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 Server-Sent Events (SSE) 技术实现实时数据流</li>\n<li>采用渐进式渲染策略，优先展示已获取的域名信息，同时异步加载流量和价格数据</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">安全防护措施</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>实现基于签名的接口防刷机制，所有请求需携带时间戳和加密签名</li>\n<li>采用请求频率限制（Rate Limiting）策略，防止恶意调用</li>\n</ul>\n<h1 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">成品展示</h1>\n<div><a href=\"https://trendsbar.net/domain\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://trendsbar.net/domain</a></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/62t8kvsqyy_img1.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/62t8kvsqyy_img2.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>配置为 Trendsbar 的分析链接：</div>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span class=\"token literal-property\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">https</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>trendsbar</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">net</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>zh</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>domain</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">?</span><span>q</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">=</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">{</span><span>keyword</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">}</span></code></div></pre>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/62t8kvsqyy_img3.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>",
